  speakers: 000000000500000000000000050000000000000000000000050000000000000005000000
  dialogue:
  - 'Whoa! What just happened?! '
  - Oh sorry about that, I'm a low power eel which means that instead of shocking
    you when you come near me, I can see through to your bones.
  - That's so cool!
  - Unfortunately it's not a skill the power company is looking for so I'm currently
    out of a job and looking for work. I'm Morey.
  - 'Hi Morey, I''m Finnley. I made an app to help make it easier to connect with
    other professionals. '
  - The sharks laughed at my idea but I'm going to prove them wrong by helping connect
    ReefCon attendees with businesses one fintroduction at a time!
  - Fintroduction?
  - Yes! The app is called LinkedFin and you can "Fintroduce" your connections to
    each other to help grow their professional network!
  - Hmm sounds like exactly what I need. I'll download it right now!
